cari-pasal-data

corpus/distractors.jsonl is derived from the dataset "Azzindani/ID_REG_Parsed" on Hugging Face
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/Azzindani/ID_REG_Parsed), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Rows were filtered, cleaned and sampled. The underlying regulation text is Indonesian law, which has no
copyright under UU 28/2014 Pasal 42.

corpus/core.jsonl holds Indonesian regulation text from official government sources (no copyright under
UU 28/2014 Pasal 42). One source PDF (UU 40/2007) comes from the Hugging Face dataset "Azzindani/ID_REG"
(Apache License, Version 2.0).

